OL,3,GNEWSAUnion plans new strikes over train
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFresh strike dates have been announced
OL,7,Ffor union members working at East
OL,8,FMidlands Railway (EMR) over "safety
OL,9,Fconcerns" with a new fleet of trains.
OL,11,FThe Rail, Maritime and Transport (RMT)
OL,12,Funion has been in dispute with EMR
OL,13,Fsince April following the rollout of
OL,14,Fthe Aurora (Class 810 fleet), which it
OL,15,Fsaid had been operating with a
OL,16,F"significant number" of faults.
OL,18,FThe union said its members would strike
OL,19,Ffor 48 hours from 30 August - the bank
OL,20,Fholiday weekend - and for 24 hours on
OL,21,F16 September, following three strikes
OL,22,Fon Saturdays in August.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
